@title Docked windows stack from the top: three windows open in the right strip, fold and unfold in place, order stays (3d, 1366x768)
@area Windows
@sizes 1366x768
open_starter_example
wait 30
click_text 3D
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text preferences
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text standards check
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text cooling what-if
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot three-open
check_layout
# Fold the first window: it keeps its title row at the top, the others move up under it.
click 1063 54
wait 30
shot first-folded
check_layout
# Unfold it again: it grows downward and nothing jumps to the bottom of the strip.
click 1063 54
wait 30
shot first-unfolded
check_layout
